4
00:01:16,625 --> 00:01:17,917
♪ Music continues ♪

5
00:01:25,667 --> 00:01:26,958
♪ I ♪

6
00:01:28,292 --> 00:01:31,958
♪ Will walk among the stones ♪

7
00:01:33,250 --> 00:01:37,000
♪ Until I feel the trembling ♪

8
00:01:39,792 --> 00:01:42,167
♪ In my legs ♪

9
00:01:44,417 --> 00:01:49,125
♪ Sometimes I'm afraid, I know ♪

10
00:01:49,500 --> 00:01:52,583
♪ Sometimes I'm ashamed ♪

11
00:01:59,875 --> 00:02:00,917
♪ I'm ♪

12
00:02:02,292 --> 00:02:06,208
♪ Sitting in a deserted crater ♪

13
00:02:07,625 --> 00:02:11,500
♪ Still waiting for the tremor ♪

14
00:02:14,167 --> 00:02:16,333
♪ In my body ♪

15
00:02:19,125 --> 00:02:23,458
♪ Nobody saw me leave, I know ♪

16
00:02:24,375 --> 00:02:26,958
♪ Nobody is waiting for me ♪

17
