♪ There's a crack ♪

18
00:02:34,458 --> 00:02:36,375
♪ In my heart ♪

19
00:02:36,458 --> 00:02:38,417
♪ A planet ♪

20
00:02:39,625 --> 00:02:42,167
♪ Full of disappointment ♪

21
00:02:56,042 --> 00:02:57,208
♪ I know ♪

22
