♪ Just one more time ♪

1898
01:27:28,417 --> 01:27:32,208
♪ Holding hands ♪

1899
01:27:32,292 --> 01:27:36,417
♪ With the world under our arms ♪

1900
01:27:36,500 --> 01:27:39,833
♪ Without looking back ♪

1901
01:27:53,958 --> 01:27:56,292
♪ Music continues ♪

1902
